Workshop voice dictation ships two third-party components. Neither is part of this
source tree; the installer downloads them and verifies them against voice/MODEL.lock.json.

1. Whisper model weights (one of ggml-large-v3-turbo-q5_0.bin, ggml-small.bin,
   ggml-base.bin, chosen per machine at install time)
   Copyright (c) 2022 OpenAI. Licensed under the MIT License.
   Source: https://github.com/openai/whisper
   ggml conversion published by the whisper.cpp project:
   https://huggingface.co/ggerganov/whisper.cpp

2. whisper.cpp (the `voice-engine` helper is built from it)
   Copyright (c) 2023-2024 The ggml authors. Licensed under the MIT License.
   Source: https://github.com/ggml-org/whisper.cpp
   Rust bindings: whisper-rs, released into the public domain (Unlicense).
   Source: https://codeberg.org/tazz4843/whisper-rs

